{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_15f483d5d0c948bfe8e6127d664719d02a455c1a5824d49471240ada74787872"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"coral start creates shared state, per-agent git worktrees, a grader daemon, generated CORAL.md instructions, and agent subprocesses; the manager interrupts agents with heartbeat prompts like reflect, consolidate, and pivot."},{"claim_ids":["clm_3421d849785be4547c29cc55186795a62204c0e2bfb1dc92090f5397ae4c761c"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"A grader daemon polls pending attempt JSON files in agent worktrees, runs the grader, writes scores back, and performs cleanup; agents poll the same files until results appear."},{"claim_ids":["clm_5afba1023faa04c595dba066a166b0d4ed44a956dd7754ce95cd299cbbb2b54d"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"A web dashboard exposes a POST /api/steer endpoint that validates the manager is stopped, then queues a continue_from action or marks an attempt as user-best; coral resume applies queued actions, and coral resume --from creates an in-memory steering action."},{"claim_ids":["clm_7a0b4ef34bd86f3a0b621bb265dc5cc3d50b84a886b5bbf0c31db9e3a4255943"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The stack is Python 3.11+ with Hatchling build, uv package manager, PyYAML, and a Starlette backend with React/Vite frontend for the dashboard."},{"claim_ids":["clm_cf0e14600569680463a67eec552f7a81f57687185cb935f2b70f9480c3533e14"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Agents and the grader daemon communicate entirely through the filesystem, with no RPC, sockets, or message queue."},{"claim_ids":["clm_ee1fde860d23a596c41016df08bd69a10e3eb29382052903093ce6bd3c5362ba"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Shared state lives in .coral/public/ (attempts, notes, skills, logs, heartbeat, steering, eval counter) and is symlinked into every agent worktree; grader venvs and answer keys stay hidden in .coral/private/."}],"claim_ids":["clm_15f483d5d0c948bfe8e6127d664719d02a455c1a5824d49471240ada74787872","clm_3421d849785be4547c29cc55186795a62204c0e2bfb1dc92090f5397ae4c761c","clm_5afba1023faa04c595dba066a166b0d4ed44a956dd7754ce95cd299cbbb2b54d","clm_7a0b4ef34bd86f3a0b621bb265dc5cc3d50b84a886b5bbf0c31db9e3a4255943","clm_cf0e14600569680463a67eec552f7a81f57687185cb935f2b70f9480c3533e14","clm_ee1fde860d23a596c41016df08bd69a10e3eb29382052903093ce6bd3c5362ba"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T03:57:24Z","created_by_operation":"op_2af64d625b21474f9bb084aa88c1dd00","id":"pg_04815e08ed515f1cb0b84f3448990ed7","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/human-agent-society-coral-docs-content-docs-concepts-architecture-mdx--4f3448990ed7.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_ddefbdc8cfb15952b64d02647a7d20e0"],"title":"Human-Agent-Society/CORAL/docs/content/docs/concepts/architecture.mdx @ 0123dfb939b3","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:57:24Z","updated_by_operation":"op_2af64d625b21474f9bb084aa88c1dd00"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_145461293a8a0682dec49ed8a946adac7d19ecaabfeb91af0fd16655d0606c74"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"GraderConfig requires a setuptools-style entrypoint (module.path:ClassName) resolved in a grader venv, with setup commands, timeout (default 300s), direction, private files, and args; an empty entrypoint is a load-time error."},{"claim_ids":["clm_9a3dfbcf553a54b832003c640e8a5e9914082da3237982eca3eef7b353bd6d18"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Tasks are defined by a task.yaml file with sections for task, grader, agents, islands, sharing, workspace, and run configuration."},{"claim_ids":["clm_d5533bd1e3377a071c2ae63ce897ff4fda76d5e6e90aefceb0792a09329194a0"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The coral CLI includes commands such as init, start, validate, status, log, notes, skills, wait, checkout, and heartbeat set, with dotlist key=value config overrides supported on start."}],"claim_ids":["clm_145461293a8a0682dec49ed8a946adac7d19ecaabfeb91af0fd16655d0606c74","clm_9a3dfbcf553a54b832003c640e8a5e9914082da3237982eca3eef7b353bd6d18","clm_d5533bd1e3377a071c2ae63ce897ff4fda76d5e6e90aefceb0792a09329194a0"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T03:57:24Z","created_by_operation":"op_2af64d625b21474f9bb084aa88c1dd00","id":"pg_2ec5ba37b3365fbabb392f700d45d0da","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/human-agent-society-coral-docs-content-docs-api-config-mdx-0123dfb939b-2f700d45d0da.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_7a21d6893ba35eed9cac14f0b0ee25ce"],"title":"Human-Agent-Society/CORAL/docs/content/docs/api/config.mdx @ 0123dfb939b3","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:57:24Z","updated_by_operation":"op_2af64d625b21474f9bb084aa88c1dd00"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_3c42eba3b90e2d5ed14be93cc9b6303fc1ad7d4c0f725d506ef9d946705ce7c6"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"CORAL targets iterative code search where success is measurable by a programmatic metric or LLM rubric grader, spanning optimization, math, systems, and ML tasks; it is a framework around coding agents, not a coding model."},{"claim_ids":["clm_ee1fde860d23a596c41016df08bd69a10e3eb29382052903093ce6bd3c5362ba"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Shared state lives in .coral/public/ (attempts, notes, skills, logs, heartbeat, steering, eval counter) and is symlinked into every agent worktree; grader venvs and answer keys stay hidden in .coral/private/."}],"claim_ids":["clm_3c42eba3b90e2d5ed14be93cc9b6303fc1ad7d4c0f725d506ef9d946705ce7c6","clm_ee1fde860d23a596c41016df08bd69a10e3eb29382052903093ce6bd3c5362ba"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T03:57:24Z","created_by_operation":"op_2af64d625b21474f9bb084aa88c1dd00","id":"pg_3bd1a838ad9756a3951b920382d277a3","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/human-agent-society-coral-docs-public-llms-txt-0123dfb939b3-920382d277a3.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_53eb909ae7fc596e8104f84937ba24a1"],"title":"Human-Agent-Society/CORAL/docs/public/llms.txt @ 0123dfb939b3","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:57:24Z","updated_by_operation":"op_2af64d625b21474f9bb084aa88c1dd00"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_126a818828fc5fa39f06e210bd38b6c840d848de7d23f950b5aeff418a258820"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"A skills-first plugin (no MCP) for Claude Code and Codex teaches the coral workflow, scaffolds a .coral_workspace with a seed and grader, and loops coral validate until launch-ready; it includes coral-task-author and coral-run-doctor subagents on Claude Code."},{"claim_ids":["clm_15f483d5d0c948bfe8e6127d664719d02a455c1a5824d49471240ada74787872"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"coral start creates shared state, per-agent git worktrees, a grader daemon, generated CORAL.md instructions, and agent subprocesses; the manager interrupts agents with heartbeat prompts like reflect, consolidate, and pivot."},{"claim_ids":["clm_2b2a5c0e9ab28f334d6022174762e1e3d9ddfe36689f7e69aba58e5ebd5753a5"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: contributors install dev deps with uv sync --extra dev, run tests via uv run pytest tests/ -v, and lint/format with ruff; CONTRIBUTING.md and AGENTS.md cover PR workflow and rules for agent-authored contributions."},{"claim_ids":["clm_642ecc87f8d114510b4607622cddbb5cd26f19a1dd8564ff83e91bcd69aa67a1"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"In Docker sessions the agent runs as an unprivileged user while the manager and grader stay root, preventing agents from reading .coral/private/ grader material; on the host this isolation is opt-in via agents.isolate_user."},{"claim_ids":["clm_79e8877558d9eaf91ce5e5890999044b24a08ed93b0d6966189de4ee440695df"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Some built-in graders (e.g. SWE-bench, terminal-bench) use Harbor to run evaluations in Docker containers, and CORAL itself must not run inside Docker in that case."},{"claim_ids":["clm_d5533bd1e3377a071c2ae63ce897ff4fda76d5e6e90aefceb0792a09329194a0"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The coral CLI includes commands such as init, start, validate, status, log, notes, skills, wait, checkout, and heartbeat set, with dotlist key=value config overrides supported on start."},{"claim_ids":["clm_ee1fde860d23a596c41016df08bd69a10e3eb29382052903093ce6bd3c5362ba"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Shared state lives in .coral/public/ (attempts, notes, skills, logs, heartbeat, steering, eval counter) and is symlinked into every agent worktree; grader venvs and answer keys stay hidden in .coral/private/."}],"claim_ids":["clm_126a818828fc5fa39f06e210bd38b6c840d848de7d23f950b5aeff418a258820","clm_15f483d5d0c948bfe8e6127d664719d02a455c1a5824d49471240ada74787872","clm_2b2a5c0e9ab28f334d6022174762e1e3d9ddfe36689f7e69aba58e5ebd5753a5","clm_642ecc87f8d114510b4607622cddbb5cd26f19a1dd8564ff83e91bcd69aa67a1","clm_79e8877558d9eaf91ce5e5890999044b24a08ed93b0d6966189de4ee440695df","clm_d5533bd1e3377a071c2ae63ce897ff4fda76d5e6e90aefceb0792a09329194a0","clm_ee1fde860d23a596c41016df08bd69a10e3eb29382052903093ce6bd3c5362ba"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T03:57:24Z","created_by_operation":"op_2af64d625b21474f9bb084aa88c1dd00","id":"pg_6bf1412d0b175d0d9b82a4a82148fe8c","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/human-agent-society-coral-readme-md-0123dfb939b3-a4a82148fe8c.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_aa242b07a9145b78970a5ad23a1cb1e5"],"title":"Human-Agent-Society/CORAL/README.md @ 0123dfb939b3","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:57:24Z","updated_by_operation":"op_2af64d625b21474f9bb084aa88c1dd00"}
